<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="804270"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="208201045"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Let Me Be With You"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ROUND TABLE"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Let Me Be With You"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:29.600"><div begin="00:06.243" end="04:28.420"><p begin="00:06.243" end="00:10.213" itunes:key="L173556">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kotoba ：kita gawa sho ri</span></p><p begin="00:15.396" end="00:19.075" itunes:key="L173557">ふたりがきっと 出会えるような<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们一定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta li ga ki to de a e lu yo u na</span></p><p begin="00:19.085" end="00:21.890" itunes:key="L173558">魔法をかけて<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma hou wo ka ke te</span></p><p begin="00:20.836" end="00:25.060" itunes:key="L173559">(Baby, baby, ooh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为微笑着两手静静的重叠在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma hou wo ka ke te</span></p><p begin="00:22.768" end="00:26.404" itunes:key="L173560">両手をそっと 重ねてほら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">双手轻轻地交叠</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">liyou te wo so to kasa ne te ho la</span></p><p begin="00:26.414" end="00:29.634" itunes:key="L173561">ほほえむから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就会微笑出来啦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ho e mu ka la</span></p><p begin="00:31.392" end="00:35.142" itunes:key="L173562">ほんとの気持ち<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假装没有注意到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to no ki mo qi</span></p><p begin="00:35.152" end="00:38.810" itunes:key="L173563">気付かないふりして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你真正的心意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu ka na yi fu li xi te</span></p><p begin="00:38.820" end="00:43.257" itunes:key="L173564">突然ふたり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">突然两个人陷入热恋</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tocu zen fu ta li koi ni o qi ta no</span></p><p begin="00:43.267" end="00:49.129" itunes:key="L173565">恋に落ちたの</p><p begin="00:50.768" end="00:54.517" itunes:key="L173932">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你在一起</span></p><p begin="00:57.706" end="01:02.120" itunes:key="L173566">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你在一起</span></p><p begin="01:05.115" end="01:09.343" itunes:key="L173933">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你在一起</span></p><p begin="01:12.411" end="01:14.755" itunes:key="L173934">だきしめたいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明想要拥抱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ki xi me ta yi no</span></p><p begin="01:19.908" end="01:24.176" itunes:key="L173570">Let Me Be With You</p><p begin="01:29.350" end="01:32.870" itunes:key="L173571">今までずっと言えないまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至今却一直未说出口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yima ma de zu to yi e na yi ma ma</span></p><p begin="01:32.880" end="01:35.827" itunes:key="L173572">隠してたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">隐藏在心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kaku xi te ta no</span></p><p begin="01:34.650" end="01:38.965" itunes:key="L173573">(Baby, baby, ooh)<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kaku xi te ta no</span></p><p begin="01:36.591" end="01:40.058" itunes:key="L173574">強がってるそれだけなの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而我却发现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cuyo ga te lu so le da ke na no</span></p><p begin="01:40.068" end="01:42.764" itunes:key="L173575">見つけだして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这种心情越发强烈</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi cu ke da xi te</span></p><p begin="01:45.173" end="01:48.663" itunes:key="L173576">待ち合わせまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">距离约定的时间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma qi a wa se ma de</span></p><p begin="01:48.970" end="01:52.354" itunes:key="L173577">あと5分待ってて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有5分钟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a to go fun ma te te</span></p><p begin="01:52.364" end="01:56.574" itunes:key="L173578">そのあとふたり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">之后两个人一起坠入爱河</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no a to fu ta li koi ni o qi ta no</span></p><p begin="01:56.984" end="02:00.073" itunes:key="L173579">恋に落ちたの</p><p begin="02:04.315" end="02:08.452" itunes:key="L173580">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你在一起</span></p><p begin="02:11.476" end="02:15.780" itunes:key="L173581">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你在一起</span></p><p begin="02:18.907" end="02:23.471" itunes:key="L173582">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你在一起</span></p><p begin="02:26.697" end="02:28.529" itunes:key="L173583">泣きたくなるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想哭啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ki ta ku na lu no</span></p><p begin="02:59.874" end="03:06.877" itunes:key="L173584">つないだ手をそっと はなすとき<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧握的手放开的时候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cu na yi da te wo so to ha na su to ki</span></p><p begin="03:06.972" end="03:10.212" itunes:key="L173585">不安になるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感到一阵不安 感到一阵不安</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu an ni na lu no fu an ni na lu no</span></p><p begin="03:10.502" end="03:17.296" itunes:key="L173586">不安になるの</p><p begin="03:18.551" end="03:21.637" itunes:key="L173587">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你在一起</span></p><p begin="03:25.379" end="03:30.027" itunes:key="L173588">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你在一起</span></p><p begin="03:32.649" end="03:37.151" itunes:key="L173589">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你在一起</span></p><p begin="03:40.212" end="03:46.455" itunes:key="L173590">だきしめたいのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明想要拥抱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ki xi me ta yi no ni</span></p><p begin="03:48.084" end="03:51.840" itunes:key="L173935">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你在一起</span></p><p begin="03:54.835" end="03:59.805" itunes:key="L173936">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明想要拥抱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ki xi me ta yi no ni</span></p><p begin="03:55.293" end="04:01.005" itunes:key="L173594">だきしめたいのに<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ki xi me ta yi no ni</span></p><p begin="04:02.162" end="04:06.825" itunes:key="L173938">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你在一起</span></p><p begin="04:09.611" end="04:14.794" itunes:key="L173939">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明想要拥抱你</span></p><p begin="04:09.872" end="04:16.282" itunes:key="L173596">だきしめたいのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明就想要抱紧你</span></p><p begin="04:17.112" end="04:21.172" itunes:key="L173941">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你在一起</span></p><p begin="04:24.383" end="04:28.420" itunes:key="L173942">Let Me Be With You<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你在一起</span></p></div></body></tt>